Correct Vulkan sampler barriers for compute shader reads.

WHY THIS IS A PATCH
    SDL represents graphics and compute texture sampling with the same
    VULKAN_TEXTURE_USAGE_MODE_SAMPLER state. Its default barrier stage mask
    covers only vertex and fragment shaders, so a compute sampler read can run
    outside the dependency. ALL_COMMANDS covers that shared usage while keeping
    SDL's shader-read access mask and image layouts unchanged. The private queue
    patch retains its later queue-enabled override.

WHEN IT STOPS APPLYING
    Pinned SDL commit: fa2c02bb6e21974a89ea9824bc53c9932abe5f9c.
    Re-point the source and destination SAMPLER branches in
    src/gpu/vulkan/SDL_gpu_vulkan.c. Do not edit mono.vendor/sdl in place.

